# This file contains NO key and is never read by the server.
#
# Credentials live in ~/.config/gmgn/.env, outside the repo, so a key can't
# be committed by accident. Two entries:
#
#   GMGN_API_KEY       your GMGN OpenAPI key
#   GMGN_PRIVATE_KEY   the Ed25519 private key in PEM format, on one line,
#                      required for signed endpoints
#
# To get one:
#   npx gmgn-cli config              shows a creation link
#   npx gmgn-cli config --apply <key>
